  "note": "Total Assets = Total Liabilities + Equity reconciles exactly. Discrete-quarter figures validated to within BDT 1 rounding (interest income minus interest paid = net interest income; PBT minus tax = net profit; Q1'24 39,447,704 + discrete Q2'24 43,646,321 = 83,094,025 vs reported H1 cumulative 83,094,026). This report's own Apr'23-Jun'23 comparative column matches this dataset's 2023_Q2.json on every field except EPS (restated 0.23 here vs 0.24 contemporaneous) — same bonus-share weighted-average-share restatement pattern as prior years (AB Bank issued bonus shares between the two reports' preparation dates, raising paid-up capital from 8,609,138,310 at the time of the original Jun-2023 report to 8,781,321,070 by the time of the 2024 comparative), even though paid-up capital itself did not change between this file's own two balance-sheet dates. Contemporaneous value (0.24) is kept in 2023_Q2.json per project convention."
